/om-smhis-data/villkor-for-anvandning"}},{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b6n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sweden","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Norrköping","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"60176","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Folkborgsvägen 17"},{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b7n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Voice","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46114958000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021000696","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021000696","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:opendata-support@smhi.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sveriges meteorologiska och hydrologiska institut"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.smhi.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/9/resource/6"},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/382"},{"@id":"https://www.smhi.se/data/utforskaren-oppna-data/opendata_support_smhi.se"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-catalog.smhi.se/md/f28575c2-9229-4445-9324-a41430213fb0","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"31034"},"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://www.smhi.se/data/utforskaren-oppna-data/oceanograf_smhi.se"},"dcat:dataQuality":"Salthalt mäts nu med givare placerade på bojar i havet och färjor som trafikerar Sveriges omgivande hav. Modernare bojar har ett CTD instrument (Conductivity Temperature Depth). Historiskt utfördes mätningarna 1-6 gånger/dygn med hjälp av kemisk analys av vattenprover, antingen genom titrering eller konduktivitetsmätning. På fyrskepp mättes salthalt med en hydrometer. Mer info finns här: https://www.smhi.se/publikationer-fran-smhi/sok-publikationer/2006-05-03-fyrskeppsdata.-resultat-och-bearbetningsmetoder-med-exempel-fran-svenska-bjorn-1883---1892. I dagsläget utförs fortfarande mätningar på vattenprover men också med givare på bojar och färjor. Dessa mäter konduktivitet kompenserat för aktuell temperatur. Efter mätningen sker enkla automatiska kontroller av data innan de lagras i databasen. Grova fel rättas till. Därefter sker ibland rättelser av felaktiga eller misstänkta data vid påpekande från användarna. Kvalitetskontrollerna förbättras och automatiseras successivt.","dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/inspire/ocobs-4.atom"},{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/version/latest/parameter/4.json"},{"@id":"https://opendata-view.smhi.se/oc-obs-salinity/OF.PointObservation/wms?service=wms&request=getcapabilities"},{"@id":"https://opendata.smhi.se/ocobs/api"},{"@id":"https://www.smhi.se/data/hitta-data-for-en-plats/ladda-ner-observationer-fran-havet/salinity"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inspire"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Observation"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oceanografi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Salthalt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Öppna data"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"http://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Syfte: Assimilera och validera modeller som används inom SMHI:s verksamhet t.ex. havscirkulationsmodellen NEMO-Nordic.\n\nEnhet: PSU\n\nEgenskaper: Vattnets salthalt, mäts en gång i timmen. Insamlat från fartyg (ferrybox-system), fyrskepp  samt ett antal bojar.\n\nKvalitetskoder: Grön (G) = Kontrollerade och godkända värden. Gul (Y) = Grovt kontrollerade värden, misstänkta eller aggregerade värden. Orange (O) = Okontrollerade värden\n\nGränser: 0-40 PSU.\n\nFör mer info se:\nhttps://www.smhi.se/kunskapsbanken/oceanografi/haven-runt-sverige/temperatur-i-havet"},"dct:identifier":"f28575c2-9229-4445-9324-a41430213fb0","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2013-06-03"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-08-24"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021000696"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b0n0"},{"@id":"https://www.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b0n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"SE.OF Oceanografiska observationer - Salthalt"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/inspire/ocobs-4.atom","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/inspire/ocobs-4.atom"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/inspire/ocobs-4.atom"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nedladdningstjänst (ATOM)"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/ATOM"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b1n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API för nedladdning"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/version/latest/parameter/4.json","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/version/latest/parameter/4.json"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-download-ocobs.smhi.se/api/version/latest/parameter/4.json"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b2n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API för nedladdning"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-view.smhi.se/oc-obs-salinity/OF.PointObservation/wms?service=wms&request=getcapabilities","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-view.smhi.se/oc-obs-salinity/OF.PointObservation/wms?service=wms&request=getcapabilities"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-view.smhi.se/oc-obs-salinity/OF.PointObservation/wms?service=wms&request=getcapabilities"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visningstjänst (WMS), stationer"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b3n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visningstjänst, stationer"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"https://opendata.smhi.se/ocobs/api","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata.smhi.se/ocobs/api"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://opendata.smhi.se/ocobs/api"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Information till utvecklare"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:bcdadcdfc7f87fbaa17c58f7ddf329e5891f5ce4fc8956bc2b5258eaff79ce42_b4n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"API-dokumentation"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/st